{"seq":9,"slug":"tiktok-ecommerce-search","title":"TikTok 电商搜索体系","stage":"DONE","category":"global-ecommerce","chapterCount":4,"docCount":10,"url":"/h/global-ecommerce/tiktok-ecommerce-search","rating":{"composite":3.75,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":4,"coverage":3,"positioning":4,"strategic":4},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":{"composite":3.44,"verdict":"neutral","uScore":3.25}},"introMarkdown":"# TikTok 电商搜索体系 简介\n\nTikTok Shop 是全球增长最快的内容电商平台之一，其搜索体系与传统货架式电商存在本质差异。在 TikTok 的生态中，搜索不仅是用户主动寻找商品的工具，更是连接短视频、直播与商品之间的关键桥梁。用户可能在观看视频后触发搜索行为，也可能通过搜索进入直播间完成购买决策，这种内容与商务深度融合的搜索模式，要求搜索系统同时理解内容语义和商业意图。\n\n本知识库适合 TikTok 全球电商搜索团队的开发工程师、产品经理、搜索策略运营人员，以及对内容电商搜索架构感兴趣的技术从业者。读者应具备基本的搜索系统认知和电商业务理解，内容聚焦 TikTok Shop 站内搜索的架构设计、内容召回策略、意图理解和全球化适配等核心技术主题。\n\n第1章**搜索架构与流量分发**从系统全局视角解析 TikTok 电商搜索的整体架构，涵盖主信息流搜索入口与电商专区搜索的联动机制、视频和直播场景下的搜索锚点触发逻辑，以及搜索流量在不同商业场景中的分配策略，帮助读者建立对 TikTok 搜索系统的结构性认知。\n\n第2章**内容召回与展示逻辑**深入内容电商场景下的搜索召回与排序机制，分析 TikTok 如何在海量短视频和直播内容中完成电商相关内容的精准召回，探讨直播间卡片与视频商品卡片的展示设计，以及多模态搜索在提升商品发现效率中的应用。\n\n第3章**用户意图与个性化**聚焦跨语言、跨文化场景下的用户搜索意图识别，探讨多语言查询理解的技术挑战、用户行为序列驱动的个性化搜索策略，以及如何在全球多市场环境中实现搜索结果的千人千面。\n\n第4章**全球化适配与转化优化**从全球运营视角出发，分析不同区域市场的消费偏好差异如何影响搜索策略，讲解跨境供给与本地需求的匹配机制，以及从搜索到下单的全链路转化路径优化方法。\n\n推荐按章节顺序学习：先通过第1章理解 TikTok 搜索系统的整体架构和流量逻辑，再在第2章深入内容召回与展示的技术细节，然后通过第3章掌握意图理解和个性化的核心方法，最后在第4章学习全球化场景下的适配与转化策略。四章内容从架构到细节、从理解到转化，构成 TikTok 电商搜索的完整知识体系。\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"search-architecture-traffic","title":"搜索架构与流量分发","docCount":3,"url":"/h/global-ecommerce/tiktok-ecommerce-search/search-architecture-traffic","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"tiktok-search-architecture-integration","title":"主站搜索与电商搜索的架构融合","url":"/h/global-ecommerce/tiktok-ecommerce-search/search-architecture-traffic/tiktok-search-architecture-integration"},{"seq":2,"slug":"tiktok-search-traffic-allocation","title":"主站搜索与电商搜索的流量分配机制","url":"/h/global-ecommerce/tiktok-ecommerce-search/search-architecture-traffic/tiktok-search-traffic-allocation"},{"seq":3,"slug":"tiktok-ecommerce-anchor-trigger","title":"电商锚点触发逻辑","url":"/h/global-ecommerce/tiktok-ecommerce-search/search-architecture-traffic/tiktok-ecommerce-anchor-trigger"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"content-recall-display","title":"内容召回与展示逻辑","docCount":3,"url":"/h/global-ecommerce/tiktok-ecommerce-search/content-recall-display","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"tiktok-ecommerce-content-recall-ranking","title":"电商内容召回与排序规则","url":"/h/global-ecommerce/tiktok-ecommerce-search/content-recall-display/tiktok-ecommerce-content-recall-ranking"},{"seq":2,"slug":"tiktok-live-video-card-display","title":"直播电商卡片与视频电商卡片展示逻辑","url":"/h/global-ecommerce/tiktok-ecommerce-search/content-recall-display/tiktok-live-video-card-display"},{"seq":3,"slug":"tiktok-multimodal-search-ecommerce","title":"多模态搜索在电商中的应用","url":"/h/global-ecommerce/tiktok-ecommerce-search/content-recall-display/tiktok-multimodal-search-ecommerce"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"user-intent-personalization","title":"用户意图与个性化","docCount":2,"url":"/h/global-ecommerce/tiktok-ecommerce-search/user-intent-personalization","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"tiktok-multilingual-intent-recognition","title":"多语言多地区电商搜索意图识别","url":"/h/global-ecommerce/tiktok-ecommerce-search/user-intent-personalization/tiktok-multilingual-intent-recognition"},{"seq":2,"slug":"tiktok-personalized-search-recommendation","title":"基于用户行为数据的个性化推荐策略","url":"/h/global-ecommerce/tiktok-ecommerce-search/user-intent-personalization/tiktok-personalized-search-recommendation"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"globalization-conversion","title":"全球化适配与转化优化","docCount":2,"url":"/h/global-ecommerce/tiktok-ecommerce-search/globalization-conversion","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"tiktok-global-adaptation-supply-matching","title":"全球化适配与跨境供给匹配","url":"/h/global-ecommerce/tiktok-ecommerce-search/globalization-conversion/tiktok-global-adaptation-supply-matching"},{"seq":2,"slug":"tiktok-search-conversion-optimization","title":"从搜索输入到电商卡片点击购买的转化路径","url":"/h/global-ecommerce/tiktok-ecommerce-search/globalization-conversion/tiktok-search-conversion-optimization"}]}]}